ob filename text manuscript be input ya
exists su name mind model ob text "qwen3.5:9b" be default ya

su name source stage from filename of ob of manuscript become wo text to name text source be read do

su name title stage ob name text source fromtext text "Create a compelling YouTube title (max 90 chars). Plain text only." for name mind to name text title be write do

su name title out ob name text title be write do
